  "description": "\"I want to sleep with you.\" \n\n\"...What?\" \n\n\"I want to do it with Sung Ji-Won.\"\n\nThe day I turned 20. I spent the night with you, trying to make a memory. That's how we met again after 10 years, Joo Sung-Hyun, still handsome...\n\n\"Interest-free loan, limit is up to you, you don't have to pay it back.\"\n\n\"...What?\"  \n\"Keep going, acting like a live-in girlfriend.\" \n\nYou still threw the wrong fastball, and I caught it. Joo Sung-Hyun, what are your true feelings?\n\n**Original Novel:**    \n[Chapters](https://series.naver.com/novel/detail.series?productNo=11244282), [Volumes](https://series.naver.com/novel/detail.series?productNo=12414320), [Volumes (Side Story)](https://series.naver.com/novel/detail.series?productNo=12414330)\n\n**Original Webtoon:**     \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=840969), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=12908635)\n\n**Official Translations:**    \n[French](https://www.webtoons.com/fr/romance/my-first-love-confession/list?title_no=9108), [Indonesian](https://www.webtoons.com/id/romance/my-first-love-confession/list?title_no=8799), [Japanese](https://manga.line.me/product/periodic?id=Z0004166)",
